{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["The word <b>ופן.</b> A short form: that you do like their deeds." "<b>ואעשה כן גם אני.</b> For the worship of HaShem, and you think that you are doing good — do not do so, for HaShem abhors all their deeds. And the witness: 'also their children' (Deuteronomy 12:31). 'The thing that I have commanded you, it you shall observe' (Deuteronomy 12:32)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:23:20.401580258Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}